  "id": "air-fryer-sausage-peppers-and-onions",
  "name": "Air-Fryer Sausage, Peppers, and Onions",
  "subtitle": "Italian sausages with seasoned peppers and onions on toasted provolone buns.",
  "description": "A simple air-fryer dinner of sweet sausage links and tender peppers and onions, served as warm sandwiches.",
